    {
      "name": "ui-page",
      "description": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Page root. `layout=\"document\"` (default) scrolls the document; `layout=\"app\"` is a full-height shell placed by tag: `<header>` on top, `<nav>` at the start side, `<aside>` at the end side, `<footer>` at the bottom, and one other child (usually `<main>`) as the main region, which scrolls. Each region takes one child: wrap the main content in a single `<main>`."
      },
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "layout",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Document flow or app shell. Default `document`."
